<hgroup><h1>Identification of the phosphatase essential for riboflavin biosynthesis in <em>Aquifex aeolicus</em>
</h1></hgroup><div class="cg p">
<a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Hoffpauir%20ZA"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id1"><span class="name western">Zoe A Hoffpauir</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id1">
<h3><span class="name western">Zoe A Hoffpauir</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>1</sup>Department of Chemistry, 1 UTSA Circle, University of Texas at San Antonio, San Antonio, Texas, USA</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Hoffpauir%20ZA"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Zoe A Hoffpauir</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>1</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Lamb%20AL"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id2"><span class="name western">Audrey L Lamb</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id2">
<h3><span class="name western">Audrey L Lamb</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>1</sup>Department of Chemistry, 1 UTSA Circle, University of Texas at San Antonio, San Antonio, Texas, USA</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Lamb%20AL"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Audrey L Lamb</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>1,</sup><sup>∗</sup>
</div>
